{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34039","headline":"鸳鸯二首 二 · 皮日休","name":"鸳鸯二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钿𨯥雕镂费深功，舞妓衣边绣莫穷\n无日不来湘渚上，有时还在镜湖中。\n烟浓共拂芭蕉雨，浪细双游菡萏风。\n应笑豪家鹦鹉伴，年年徒被锁金笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}